# 도메인 단위: 찾기 모델 project_path_gateway__domain_scan_group EXTRACTED RESOLVED (기능 008 research R-07, data-model 3.4)
# 해석 결과로 분류하고 같은 분류·경로를 합쳐 정렬한 뒤 새 후보·확인 필요에 제안 키를 붙인다. 첫 줄은 요약 N이다.
target lib-func project_path_gateway__domain_scan_group
layer domain

# 분류 순서(새 후보, 이미 등록, 등록 불가, 확인 필요, 루트 참조)와 요약 줄

case group-classes-in-order
arg ROOT\t/r\nK\tSRC_DIR\nG\tdir:SRC_DIR\tsrc\nT\t1\tb\tdocs\t\nO\t1\tscripts/b.sh\t2\t-\tdocs\nT\t2\tb\tsrc\t\nO\t2\tscripts/b.sh\t3\t-\tsrc\nT\t3\tb\tMakefile\t\nO\t3\tscripts/b.sh\t4\t-\tMakefile\nT\t4\tp\tbuild/out.txt\t\nO\t4\tscripts/b.sh\t5\t-\tbuild/out.txt\nT\t5\tr\t\t\nO\t5\tscripts/b.sh\t1\t-\t"$(dirname\s"$0")/.."\nP\t1
arg S\t5\troot\t-\t-\t\nS\t4\tmissing\tfile\t-\tbuild/out.txt\nS\t3\tblocked\tfile\tnot_file_path\tMakefile\nS\t2\tok\tdir\t-\tsrc\nS\t1\tok\tdir\t-\tdocs
status 0
out N\t1\t1\t1\t1\t1\t1
out C\tnew\tdir\tDOCS\tdocs
out @\tscripts/b.sh\t2\t-\tdocs
out C\tregistered\tdir\tdir:SRC_DIR\tsrc
out @\tscripts/b.sh\t3\t-\tsrc
out C\tblocked\tfile\tnot_file_path\tMakefile
out @\tscripts/b.sh\t4\t-\tMakefile
out C\tmissing\tfile\tBUILD_OUT_TXT\tbuild/out.txt
out @\tscripts/b.sh\t5\t-\tbuild/out.txt
out C\troot\t-\t-\t
out @\tscripts/b.sh\t1\t-\t"$(dirname "$0")/.."

# 같은 경로는 한 후보로 합치고 위치는 스크립트 → 줄 번호(숫자) 순서, 같은 위치·같은 원문은 한 번

